    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "***EXCELLENT LOCATION/ 3 BED 3 BATH / STATE-OF-THE-ART CAT6 WIRED CONNECTION/ OFF-STREET PARKING/ ADDITIONAL STREET PARKING***\r\n\r\nKelly Bradshaw is delighted to introduce Number 10 The Paddocks Drive to the market. This fine 3 bed, 3 bath terraced home is located in the much sought-after Adamstown  in Lucan and offers a practical and spacious layout with bright living areas.\r\n\r\nThe attractive cobblelock driveway, bordered by lawn on both sides, provides valuable off-street parking to the front. Additional street parking is also available.\r\n\r\nThe welcoming hallway initially leads into the large light-filled sitting room which features an oversized window with views to the front. This room boasts an attractively pale LVP floor. A notable feature in this room, and throughout the home, is the state-of-the-art Cat6 wired connection which offers stability and consistent maximum internet speeds.\r\n\r\nThe rear hallway leads on into the open-plan kitchen/dining area with tiled flooring and splashback. There are fully-fitted cabinets and ample storage and worktop space. French doors provide excellent natural light and open directly to the generous rear garden. The rear garden is enclosed and includes a patio area, lawn, mature planting and a useful shed.  A guest WC is positioned under the stairs for convenience and completes the ground floor accommodation.\r\n\r\nThe first floor boasts two double bedrooms with built-in wardrobes and one single bedroom. One of the double bedrooms comes with ensuite bathroom. There is also a generously proportioned fully-tiled family bathroom with bath.\r\n\r\nThis home's convenient location offers every possible amenity on your doorstep. It is situated within close proximity to the N4, M4, M50 and Adamstown Train Station, as well as Liffey Valley, Ballyowen Shopping Centre and a variety of bars & restaurants. There is an abundance of sports grounds, leisure facilities, creche facilities and both primary & secondary schools within walking distance. Hansfield Medical Centre is also close by. \r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended."
      },
